om  increased lobbies and colors to brand  new roles as engineers a player can vent  like the imposters camp as a scientist  you can keep a constant eye on  everyone's heart rate to see who dies  and there's a shape-shifter too who can  morph into other players among us has  definitely evolved wait there's a  guardian angel who can protect other  players and there's an in-game star too  december 14th is the day the playstation  xbox fan joined the party  take a looksie at white shadows a 2.5 d  puzzle platformer in the vein of great  games like limbo and inside incredibly  atmospheric in an unsettling way it's  essentially a commentary on modern life  told through raven girl and her attempt  to escape a plague ridden city in a  world where only the wealthy can afford  to live escape is everything my fellow  limbo fans you should know that white  shadows drops on playstation xbox and pc  on december the 7th  december is full of platformers another  one releasing this month is solar ash  but the key difference here is speed  solar ash is all about flow chaining  together skills to seamlessly explore  the world skating across the ground or  jumping effortlessly stabbing those in  your way timing becomes a key mechanic  especially in boss fights and the art  style is something you'll either love or  hate solo ash hits playstation and pc on  december 2nd at this point i really  wanted to talk about tmnt shredders  revenge but that game has now been  postponed to 2022 rip not cowabunga  that's pretty much it for the full price  games this month so let's do free stuff  i don't think we can call this first  game a game it's more of an experience  if you're on playstation or pc right now  you can try out kid amnesia back in 2000  2001 radiohead made back to back  critically acclaimed albums called kid a  and amnesia you see how the title works  now this exhibition brings together  recordings from the band and visuals  from someone's dark mind together in an  experimental pre