ore  meeting a paywall  enough time to see if final fantasy 14  is your jam and if you want to spend  hundreds of hours living in this world  so there we have it december isn't the  greatest month for new video games this  time around but holy heck wait until you  see the games releasing from february  2022 next year is going to blow your  socks off i'm adam you're awesome i  challenge you this month to reveal  something weird about yourself in the  comments i'll go first something weird  about me i bite my own toenails i  probably shouldn't have said that anyway  thanks for staying till the end see ya  [Music]

